FILEDERIVATIVED(8)          System Manager's Manual         FILEDERIVATIVED(8)

NAME
     filederivatived – Extract text index information.

SYNOPSIS
     filederivatived

DESCRIPTION
     filederivatived extracts text and index data from user files for indexing
     and intelligence features.  filederivatived should not be invoked
     directly.

